  message: "Reopened (real-repro validation 2026-07-18, docspell=~/ALL_REPOS/repos_Apr12_2026/docspell): Scala funnels wide open. 242 copy/setTo calls resolve @0.85 (ast_call) to internal defs; 65 suppressed; 0 legit. Magnet: copy<-71 src files->FileCopyTask.copy, setTo<-46->ColumnOps.setTo. Ground truth: InputEnv.addEnv does `copy(env=env.add(...))` = the case-class .copy() (returns InputEnv), misbound to the unrelated FileCopyTask.copy. Case-class .copy() is ubiquitous. Cause: gate only extracts receiver types from annotated-vals + ctor-params; misses .copy() on method-returns/for-bindings/expressions. Design pending 3-lens investigation."  # 8cb0
